# EUREKA: In-Silico Biophysics & Generative Biology Workbench
# GitHub Linguist Language Calibration Configuration

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exclude Web Markup, Styling, Media, and Non-Programming Formats
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.html -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*/**/*.html -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*.css -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*/**/*.css -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*.svg -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*/**/*.svg -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*.json -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*/**/*.json -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*.webm -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
*.mp4 -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exclude Documentation, External References, and Media Archives
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/** linguist-documentation
ref_pins/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
whatsapp_docs/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
assets/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
frontend/public/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Core Production Code & Scientific Simulation Languages
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.py linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Python
*.ipynb linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Jupyter\ Notebook
*.sh linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Shell
*.js linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=JavaScript
*.jsx linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=JavaScript

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored Auxiliary Components & Test Suites
# (Calibrates Linguist language breakdown to Python ~56.1%, JS ~43.9%)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
ai_models/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
frontend/src/pipelineArchitecture.js -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
frontend/src/targetHub.js -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
frontend/src/components/discovery/GeneticsStudioPage.jsx -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
frontend/src/components/discovery/AntibodyDesignStudio.jsx -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored
frontend/src/components/archive/** -linguist-detectable linguist-vendored

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line Ending Normalization Across Windows & Linux POSIX
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
